  m_text: "<size=19>-One or more              can appear randomly in any spin at the
    bottom of reels.\n        -Only one bubble can appear per reel each spin.\n-Each
    spin, it moves up by one position along the reel.\n-<b><style=coinColor>Bubble
    Feature</style></b> is triggered if a bubble lands on              . In this case,
    player will get a prize\n written on the bubble.\n        -Bubbles can award <b>Coin
    Prize</b> or <b>Jackpot</b>."
