      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=19>-Through <b><style=coinColor>Mini Pick Bonus Game</style></b>,
    <b><style=coinColor>Colossal Delight Free Games</style></b> can be triggered.\n-During
    <b><style=coinColor>Colossal Delight Free Games</style></b>, one or more                         can
    appear randomly in any spin\n at the bottom of reels.\n        -Only one bubble
    can appear per reel each spin.\n-If              lands on              , then
    reelset will be expended up to <b>8x5</b>.\n-During <b><style=coinColor>Colossal
    Delight Free Games</style></b>, bubbles appear in <b>1x1</b>, <b>2x2</b> or <b>3x3</b>
    size.\n-No re-trigger allowed."
